      "q": "1.\nClass 4 Chapter 14 Smart Charts Notes\nLearning Outcomes of Each Topic of Class 4 Maths and Time Required to Spend on Each Topic\nThe topics and Sub-topics covered in class 4 Maths are given below.\nS.No\nTopic Name\nSub-topics\nTime Required\n1\nGeometry\nShapes and spatial understanding\n16 hrs.\n2\nNumbers\nNumbers and operations,\nMental arithmetics,\nFractional numbers\n40 hrs.\n3\nMoney\nMoney\n5 hrs.\n4\nMeasurement\nLength,\nWeight,\nVolume,\nTime\n21 hrs.\n5\nData Handling\nData collection and representation in form of bar graphs\n6 hrs.\n6\nPatterns\nIdentification of patterns based on multiplication and division,\nIdentification of patterns based on geometry using symmetry\n6 hrs.\nNCERT Solutions for 4th Class Maths Chapter Wise Mark Weightage\nCBSE board assigns different marking schemes to different subjects. Following these regulations, the marks weightage for the subject Maths for Class 4 has an internal assessment as well as an external assessment. The internal assessment is for 20 marks while the external assessments are for 80 marks. Students are advised to study all the chapters for their Maths examinations as questions from all the chapters are asked. Moreover, external assessments carry more marks weightage and are therefore important to focus on.\nFeatures of NCERT Maths Solutions for Class 4\nVedantu\u2019s NCERT Maths Solutions for Class 4 have been created by the top subject matter experts so that you can learn more effectively and clear your doubts.\nAll the solutions have been written in an easy-to-understand language so that all students can use them.\nIn these solutions, problems have been solved in a step-by-step manner. All the related information and formulas are given so that you can recall them easily.\nAll the NCERT solutions are available in a PDF format so that you can download them easily and refer to them at your convenience.\nYou can use the chapter-wise NCERT Solutions for Maths for Class 4 for practising your concepts. You can also download the Vedantu app to get more such resources.\nCBSE Class 4 Maths Study Materials\nS.No.\nOther Sudy Materials for Class 4 Maths\n1\nCBSE Class 4 Maths NCERT Books\n2\nCBSE Class 4 Maths Worksheet\n3\nCBSE Class 4 Maths Syllabus\n4\nCBSE Class 4 Maths Revision Notes\nConclusion\nThe NCERT Class 4 Maths solutions created by Vedantu are designed to provide clear and comprehensive assistance for students. These solutions are meticulously crafted to align with the NCERT curriculum, ensuring that they cover all the key concepts and topics in a structured manner. Vedantu's solutions are particularly beneficial because they break down complex problems into easy-to-understand steps, making learning more accessible for young students. This step-by-step approach helps in building a strong foundation in mathematics, which is crucial at this stage of education.",
